expect Lichess
# The first screen leads with the one thing that needs no account, and lists
# the rest under it. The times are a tap further, on Play online.
expect Play the computer
expect Play online
expect Your games
expect Puzzles
expect How to play
expect-missing 10+0
expect-missing Rated
expect-missing home-next
clean
shot home
tap How to play
expect Chess on Lichess
expect Outlined squares show the last move.
# How to play turns a page at the larger text sizes; at the default size it
# is one page and draws no pager.
maybe-tap-id help-next
expect Play online lists the times
wait 250
clean
shot lichess-help
tap Play
expect Play the computer
tap Puzzles
wait-for Download 32 puzzles
expect-missing Resume puzzle
tap Back
expect Play the computer
tap-id play-online
wait-for Not connected
expect 10 minutes each
expect Plus 5 seconds a move
expect No time added
expect Rated
expect Casual
clean
shot play-online
tap-id seek-10-0
wait-for Connect Lichess
expect Connect a Lichess account to play people. Playing the computer and Puzzles work without one.
expect-missing Challenge player
clean
shot time-tile-without-account
tap Connect Lichess
wait-for Account key
expect lichess.org/account/oauth/token
expect Use phone
clean
shot connect-prompt
tap Use phone
wait-for Opens the Lichess token page
clean
shot connect-phone
tap Back
wait-for Account key
tap Back
wait-for Connect Lichess
tap Back
wait-for Play the computer
tap-id play-online
wait-for 10 minutes each
tap-id seek-casual
tap Back
wait-for Play the computer
tap-id play-online
wait-for 10 minutes each
clean
shot online-casual
tap Back
wait-for Play the computer
tap-id play-computer
wait-for Start game
expect No clock
expect Random
tap-id computer-side-black
tap-id start-computer
wait-for Kobo
expect Black · Your move · Casual · Nc3
expect-missing 10:00
clean
shot computer-black-untimed
tap-id square-e7
expect e7 →
tap-id square-e5
wait-for Black · Your move · Casual · Nf3
expect-missing e7 →
expect-missing Move sent
clean
shot computer-reply-outlined
tap-id game-menu
tap-id confirm-resign
tap-id resign
wait-for New game
expect See the board
clean
shot computer-result
tap-id computer-again
wait-for Start game
